 corner cases, and divide-by-zero through the bounded execution path.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed retirement-order and forward-progress tests for back-to-back divide operations and divide results consumed by following instructions.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": false, \"error\": \"formal_failed: insn_div_ch0\\n:17:21 [insn_xor_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: pass\\nSBY 10:17:21 [insn_xor_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:07 (7)\\nSBY 10:17:21 [insn_xor_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:06 (6)\\nSBY 10:17:21 [insn_xor_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned pass\\nSBY 10:17:21 [insn_xor_ch0] summary: engine_0 did not produce any traces\\nSBY 10:17:21 [insn_xor_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\nSBY 10:19:59 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:03:50  Status: passed\\nSBY 10:19:59 [reg_ch0] engine_0: finished (returncode=0)\\nSBY 10:19:59 [reg_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: pass\\nSBY 10:19:59 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:03:51 (231)\\nSBY 10:19:59 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:03:14 (194)\\nSBY 10:19:59 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned pass\\nSBY 10:19:59 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 did not produce any traces\\nSBY 10:19:59 [reg_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\n\\nFormal: 51 passed, 2 failed\\nFailed: insn_div_ch0 insn_rem_ch0\\n\\n--- insn_div_ch0/logfile.txt (last 30 lines) ---\\nSBY 10:16:30 [insn_div_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 7..\\nSBY 10:16:30 [insn_div_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 8..\\nSBY 10:16:30 [insn_div_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 9..\\nSBY 10:16:30 [insn_div_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 10..\\nSBY 10:16:30 [insn_div_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 11..\\nSBY 10:16:30 [insn_div_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 12..\\nSBY 10:16:30 [insn_div_ch0] engine_0: ##   