n while retaining the current direct PC index, saturating updates, JAL handling, and decode-stage training interface.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_branch_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add reset-state tests for a cold taken branch and a cold not-taken branch, then verify counter transitions, saturation, and unchanged direct JAL prediction.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 2, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Change BHT reset initialization to weakly taken while retaining the current direct PC index, saturating updates, JAL handling, and decode-stage training interface.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_branch_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add reset-state tests for a cold taken branch and a cold not-taken branch, then verify counter transitions, saturation, and unchanged direct JAL prediction.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 338.8, \"delta_pct\": -1.9, \"vs_baseline\": 19.79, \"fmax_mhz\": 140.55, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4148503, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 10700, \"ff\": 1927, \"seeds\": [137.44, 142.25, 140.55], \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-11T16:45:01.518248Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 6, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-07-11 hyp-20260711-003-r6s2 (regression, -1.90%): With a two-bit BHT already in the fetch path, weakly-taken reset harms CoreMark more through cold forward/not-taken branches and aliases than it saves on first counted-loop back edges, so the weakly-not-taken cold bias is the better default.\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
