for formal checks.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 7, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/alu.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove real combinational DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU selection from the normal EX ALU while retaining the formal ALTOPS mapping.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/divider.sv\", \"description\": \"Add an eight-cycle radix-4 signed/unsigned divide unit with quotient/remainder selection and exact RV32M divide-by-zero and overflow handling.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Dispatch divide-class operations once, preserve their ID/EX payload during the fixed-latency operation, and emit exactly one completed EX/MEM entry.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a divider-busy interlock that freezes younger stages without suppressing older retirement or duplicate transactions.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire divider request, response, and busy state through the in-order pipeline and existing memory-stall priority.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_alu.py\", \"description\": \"Exercise exact quotient and remainder results, signed corner cases, and divide-by-zero through the bounded execution path.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed retirement-order and forward-progress tests for back-to-back divide operations and divide results consumed by following instructions.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 7, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/alu.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove real combinational DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU selection from the normal EX ALU while retaining the formal ALTOPS mapping.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/divider.sv\", \"description\": \"Add an eight-cycle radix-4 signed/unsigned divide unit with quotient/remainder selection and exact RV32M divide-by-zero and overflow handling.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Dispatch divide-class operations once, preserve their ID/EX payload duri