real combinational DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU arithmetic from the normal ALU and retain only the ALTOPS formal behavior where required.\"\n  - file: rtl/divider.sv\n    description: \"Add a signed/unsigned iterative restoring divider with quotient/remainder selection and explicit divide-by-zero and INT_MIN/-1 handling.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Dispatch divide-class ALU operations to the divider, hold their EX payload until response, and emit one normal EX/MEM result on completion.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add an MDU-busy interlock that freezes fetch/decode and preserves retirement ordering while a divide is in flight.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the divider request/response and busy interlock into the existing in-order pipeline.\"\n  - file: test/test_alu.py\n    description: \"Keep exact RV32M divide and remainder corner-case coverage against the new execution path.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
