 file: rtl/alu.sv\n    description: \"Remove real combinational DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU selection from the normal EX ALU while retaining the formal ALTOPS mapping.\"\n  - file: rtl/divider.sv\n    description: \"Add an eight-cycle radix-4 signed/unsigned divide unit with quotient/remainder selection and exact RV32M divide-by-zero and overflow handling.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Dispatch divide-class operations once, preserve their ID/EX payload during the fixed-latency operation, and emit exactly one completed EX/MEM entry.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add a divider-busy interlock that freezes younger stages without suppressing older retirement or duplicate transactions.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire divider request, response, and busy state through the in-order pipeline and existing memory-stall priority.\"\n  - file: test/test_alu.py\n    description: \"Exercise exact quotient and remainder results, signed corner cases, and divide-by-zero through the bounded execution path.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Add directed retirement-order and forward-progress tests for back-to-back divide operations and divide results consumed by following instructions.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
