\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Extend the legal aligned decode control-flow resolver to issue a direct-JAL redirect and carry a marker that EX must not recover it again.\"\n  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Generalize the ID/EX early-resolution metadata from conditional-branch-only state to decoded direct-control-flow state.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Suppress duplicate recovery only for a decode-resolved JAL while retaining EX target and misalignment-trap behavior for all control transfers.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Remove the direct-JAL predictor wiring and connect the simplified sequential fetch successor to the existing decode redirect plumbing.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Add direct-JAL decode-recovery, forwarded adjacent control flow, and misaligned-JAL trap tests covering PC order, RVFI fields, and redirect priority.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
