ity without changing the JAL-only fetch predictor.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Add clean-register canonical-return, pending-x1 fallback, and misaligned-return tests that check redirect timing, RVFI PC/order, link semantics, and trap behavior.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
