e existing load interlock and recovery semantics.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Extend the ID/EX payload with decode-resolved branch direction, successor, and misalignment metadata; remove obsolete EX/MEM branch-only payload fields.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Capture the fully bypassed conditional-branch outcome for legal ready branches, including the taken misaligned-target fault condition, alongside the existing early redirect result.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace duplicated conditional-branch comparison and target generation with the carried decode result, preserving redirect priority, trap conversion, RVFI pc_wdata, and BHT training.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/mem_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Update EX/MEM bundle assumptions after removal of branch-only fields that are no longer consumed downstream.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed cases for bypassed taken and not-taken branches, load-dependent branch interlocks, misaligned taken targets, predictor training, and RVFI PC sequencing.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Extend the ID/EX payload with decode-resolved branch direction, successor, and misalignment metadata; remove obsolete EX/MEM branch-only payload fields.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Capture the fully bypassed conditional-branch outcome for legal ready branches, including the taken misaligned-target fault condition, alongside the existing early redirect result.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace duplicated conditional-branch comparison and target generation with the carried decode result, preserving redirect priority, trap conversion, RVFI pc_wdata, and BHT training.\"}, {\"f