-r3s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r1s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-004-r12s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r3s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r1s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r10s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r12s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r2s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r6s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r9s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r9s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r4s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r3s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r1s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r11s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-006-r12s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r5s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-003-r8s2.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-001-r7s0.log\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260711-002-r8s1.log\ncores/bench/experiments/run_summary.json\ncores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20260711-003-r12s2/.agent.log\ncores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20260711-002-r12s1/.agent.log\ncores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20260711-002-r5s1/.agent.log\ncores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20260711-001-r12s0/.agent.log\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
