t, and gate each load-use comparison with its qualifier.\\\\nPreserve both-source interlocks for OP, STORE, and BRANCH, rs1 interlocks\\\\nfor OP-IMM, LOAD, and JALR, and conservatively treat every other encoding as\\\\nsource-free. This removes false immediate-field alias bubbles without\\\\nchanging decoder control, forwarding, memory ordering, or retirement.\\\\n\\\", \\\"expected_impact\\\": {\\\"fitness_delta_pct\\\": 3, \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"medium\\\"}, \\\"changes\\\": [{\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Decode conservative opcode-local rs1/rs2 use qualifiers and gate load-use comparisons so immediate and source-free encodings cannot create false stalls.\\\"}, {\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/core.sv\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Pass the complete fetched instruction to the hazard unit instead of only its raw rs1 and rs2 bit fields.\\\"}, {\\\"file\\\": \\\"test/test_pipeline.py\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Add immediate-alias-after-load cases that must not bubble, alongside OP, STORE, BRANCH, LOAD-address, and JALR dependencies that must still interlock and retire with exact RVFI state.\\\"}]}, \\\"expected_impact\\\": {\\\"fitness_delta_pct\\\": 3, \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"medium\\\"}, \\\"changes\\\": [{\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Decode conservative opcode-local rs1/rs2 use qualifiers and gate load-use comparisons so immediate and source-free encodings cannot create false stalls.\\\"}, {\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/core.sv\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Pass the complete fetched instruction to the hazard unit instead of only its raw rs1 and rs2 bit fields.\\\"}, {\\\"file\\\": \\\"test/test_pipeline.py\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Add immediate-alias-after-load cases that must not bubble, alongside OP, STORE, BRANCH, LOAD-address, and JALR dependencies that must still interlock and retire with exact RVFI state.\\\"}], \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"broken\\\", \\\"formal_passed\\\": false, \\\"cosim_passed\\