 BHT training outputs; keep branch execution, misalignment traps, resolved pc_next, and EX recovery for branches not resolved in ID.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Accept the earlier committed decode-stage training event without altering the sixteen-entry counter lookup, direct JAL prediction, or fetch-critical prediction selection.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed back-to-back and aliasing branch cases proving that ID-stage training is visible at the next lookup, saturates correctly, and preserves redirect and RVFI PC ordering.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 3, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Expose a valid, non-stalled decode-stage branch-training event carrying the resolved branch PC and direction, gated until operands are forwardable and the instruction is legal.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire decode-stage branch training to the existing predictor and remove the superseded EX-stage training connections while retaining all redirect priorities.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove redundant BHT training outputs; keep branch execution, misalignment traps, resolved pc_next, and EX recovery for branches not resolved in ID.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Accept the earlier committed decode-stage training event without altering the sixteen-entry counter lookup, direct JAL prediction, or fetch-critical prediction selection.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed back-to-back and aliasing branch cases proving that ID-stage training is visible at the next lookup, saturates correctly, and preserves redirect and RVFI PC ordering.\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 345.35, \"delta_pct\": 0.31, \"vs_baseline\": 22.11, \"fmax_mhz\": 143.27, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4148503, \"iteration