ocally while retaining older-EX and ID redirect priority over stalls.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Compare decode-resolved branch and JAL successors against local PC+4 instead of carried predictor metadata.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"For unresolved JALR recovery, compare the resolved successor with local PC+4; preserve the decode-resolution suppression and all trap paths.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Remove the obsolete predictor instance and predicted-successor wiring while preserving the external imem, dmem, and RVFI interfaces.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Cover sequential fall-through, ID-resolved branch and JAL steering, JALR recovery, redirect-over-stall priority, and RVFI PC sequencing after metadata removal.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
