 taken and not-taken branch cases, prediction warm-up and recovery, imem/dmem stall overlap, and RVFI PC/order checks.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": false, \"error\": \"formal_failed: reg_ch0\\nummary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:22 (22)\\nSBY 16:43:40 [insn_srai_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:19 (19)\\nSBY 16:43:40 [insn_srai_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned pass\\nSBY 16:43:40 [insn_srai_ch0] summary: engine_0 did not produce any traces\\nSBY 16:43:40 [insn_srai_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\nSBY 16:43:53 [insn_srli_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:34  Checking assertions in step 20..\\nSBY 16:43:53 [insn_srli_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:34  Status: passed\\nSBY 16:43:53 [insn_srli_ch0] engine_0: finished (returncode=0)\\nSBY 16:43:53 [insn_srli_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: pass\\nSBY 16:43:53 [insn_srli_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:35 (35)\\nSBY 16:43:53 [insn_srli_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:28 (28)\\nSBY 16:43:53 [insn_srli_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned pass\\nSBY 16:43:53 [insn_srli_ch0] summary: engine_0 did not produce any traces\\nSBY 16:43:53 [insn_srli_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\n\\nFormal: 52 passed, 1 failed\\nFailed: reg_ch0\\n\\n--- reg_ch0/logfile.txt (last 30 lines) ---\\nSBY 16:41:57 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 10..\\nSBY 16:41:57 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 11..\\nSBY 16:41:57 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 12..\\nSBY 16:41:57 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 13..\\nSBY 16:41:57 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 14..\\nSBY 16:41:57 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 15..\\nSBY 16:41:57 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 16..\\nSBY 16:41:57 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 17..\\nSBY 16:41:57 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 18..\\nSBY 16:4