ding the bypass,\\npending-register, and indirect-target logic that made return fast paths lose.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove the fetch-stage direct-JAL target prediction so the sequential successor is the only fetch prediction.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Generate the sequential predicted successor locally and retain the existing higher-priority decode and EX redirect handling.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Extend the legal aligned decode control-flow resolver to issue a direct-JAL redirect and carry a marker that EX must not recover it again.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Generalize the ID/EX early-resolution metadata from conditional-branch-only state to decoded direct-control-flow state.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Suppress duplicate recovery only for a decode-resolved JAL while retaining EX target and misalignment-trap behavior for all control transfers.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove the direct-JAL predictor wiring and connect the simplified sequential fetch successor to the existing decode redirect plumbing.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add direct-JAL decode-recovery, forwarded adjacent control flow, and misaligned-JAL trap tests covering PC order, RVFI fields, and redirect priority.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove the fetch-stage direct-JAL target prediction so the sequential successor is the only fetch prediction.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Generate the sequential predicted successor locally and retain the existing higher-priority decode and EX redirect handling.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"descripti