{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"pwd && git status --short && sed -n '1,80p' cores/bench/core.yaml && rg -n \\\"mem_stage|hazard_unit|ex_stage\\\" cores/bench/test cores/bench/rtl --glob '*.py' --glob '*.sv'\"","aggregated_output":"name: bench\ndescription: Frozen LLM-benchmark fixture core. Identical RTL to baseline at the bench-fixture-v1\n  freeze point. The benchmark matrix clones from the bench-fixture-v1 orphan branch\n  and operates only on this directory.\nisa: rv32im\nnret: 1\ntarget_fpga: tang-nano-20k\ntargets:\n  fmax_mhz: 135\n  lut4: 10000\n  coremark_iter_s: 300\n  coremark_per_mhz: 2.2\ncurrent:\n  fmax_mhz: 157.9\n  lut4: 7729\n  ff: 1910\n  coremark_iter_s: 2.0e-06\n  coremark_per_mhz: 0.0\n  source_id: hyp-20260711-003-r11s2\n  updated: '2026-07-11T18:17:13.215724Z'\ncores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv:1:// rtl/mem_stage.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv:18:module mem_stage (\ncores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv:31:  // for downstream RVFI use; mem_stage only consumes a subset, so the\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py:530:            \"if_stage.sv\", \"id_stage.sv\", \"ex_stage.sv\",\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py:531:            \"mem_stage.sv\", \"wb_stage.sv\",\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py:532:            \"hazard_unit.sv\", \"forward_unit.sv\",\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:10://   +- stall <- hazard_unit (load-use)\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:165:  ex_stage u_ex (\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:182:  mem_stage u_mem (\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:206:  hazard_unit u_hazard (\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:225:  // steering fetch before hazard_unit flushes it.\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:1:// rtl/ex_stage.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:15:module ex_stage (\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:1:// rtl/hazard_unit.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv:19:module hazard_unit (\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
